# --- PATIENTER --- #
### Hele listen (patienter)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/patients

### Opret patient
POST http://localhost:3000/api/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{"cpr":"0201029994","navn":"Ny Test Person"}

### Uden body — skal give 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/patients

### Ukendt sti — skal give 404
GET http://localhost:3000/findesikke

# --- MEDICIN --- #

### Hele listen (medicin)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/medicin

### Opret medicin
POST http://localhost:3000/api/medicin
Content-Type: application/json

{"patient_id":3,"navn":"Isotretinoin","dosis":"40 mg","tidspunkt":"17:00","interval_dage":1}

### Uden body — skal give 400
POST http://localhost:3000/api/medicin

# --- REGISTRERING --- #

### Hele listen (registrering)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/registrering

### Opret registrering
POST http://localhost:3000/api/registrering
Content-Type: application/json

{"medicin_id":15,"taget":true}